[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0058","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12985","title":"Citrix SD-WAN Center 和 NetScaler SD-WAN Center 命令注入漏洞","description":"Citrix SD-WAN Center 和 NetScaler SD-WAN Center 存在命令注入漏洞，由于对用户输入验证不严格，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向管理界面发送特制请求注入系统命令，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Citrix SD-WAN 10.2.3 之前版本及 NetScaler SD-WAN 10.0.8 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需认证，利用复杂度低，可完全控制目标系统。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12985"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-16T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:15:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Citrix SD-WAN 升级至 10.2.3 或更高版本，将 NetScaler SD-WAN 升级至 10.0.8 或更高版本。补丁及详细说明请参考 Citrix 安全公告 CTX251987。如无法立即升级，建议在管理界面中限制可访问 SD-WAN Center 管理端口的源 IP 地址，仅允许受信任的管理网段访问，并禁用不必要的远程管理接口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/109133","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX251987","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2019-31","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12985.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12985.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12985.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-12985.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12985.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/citrix/netscaler_sd-wan/CVE-2019-12985.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-12985.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-12985.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2019-12985.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-12985.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-12985.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0058.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0058.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0032","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1010290","title":"Babel 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Babel 多语言网站系统存在开放重定向漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 URL 的 newurl 参数发送给 redirect.php 页面，诱使受害者点击特制链接后，将用户重定向至任意外部站点。该漏洞源于程序未对重定向目标 URL 进行充分校验，可被用于钓鱼攻击、规避安全策略或传播恶意内容。攻击条件低，无需身份认证，但需用户交互。CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1010290"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-16T14:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:09:56Z","remediation":"由于 Babel 模块已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即从 CMS Made Simple 站点中删除该模块（在 CMSMS 管理后台的\"模块管理\"中卸载 Babel，或直接删除 modules/babel/ 目录）。如因业务需要暂时保留，可修改 modules/babel/redirect.php，在 newurl 参数处理前添加白名单校验：仅允许跳转到本站域名下的 URL，拒绝所有外部域名重定向；同时可在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面添加重写规则，拦截对 /modules/babel/redirect.php 的访问并返回 403。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://dev.cmsmadesimple.org/project/files/729","https://untrustednetwork.net/en/2019/02/20/open-redirection-vulnerability-in-babel/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-1010290.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-1010290.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-1010290.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-1010290.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-1010290-3701.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-1010290-3702.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-1010290-3700.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-1010290.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Babel/CVE-2019-1010290.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2019/1010xxx/CVE-2019-1010290.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-1010290.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0206","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1132","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 系统的 Win32k 内核组件在处理内存对象时存在缺陷，未经充分验证即可操作内存对象，攻击者可利用此漏洞实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Windows 7 SP1、Windows Server 2008/2008 R2 SP2/SP1 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级为高。攻击者需在目标系统上拥有低权限账户，无需用户交互即可在本地触发漏洞，通过构造特制请求利用内存处理缺陷将权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别，从而完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞已有公开利用代码，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录，Microsoft 已在 2019 年 7 月安全更新中发布修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1132"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-07-15T19:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:27:53Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 7 月安全更新（月度安全汇编），该更新修复了 Win32k 组件的内存对象处理缺陷。受影响系统包括 Windows 7 SP1、Windows Server 2008 SP2 及 Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1，应通过「设置 → 更新与安全 → Windows 更新 → 检查更新」下载并安装对应版本的累积更新补丁（详见 https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1132）。如暂无法安装补丁，可采取临时缓解措施：限制普通用户在目标系统上的本地登录权限，避免在受信任环境中运行来源不明的应用程序，通过本地安全策略禁用或卸载高风险字体驱动文件（如 eot、otf 等），并在系统启动配置中启用驱动签名强制执行（执行 bcdedit /set testsigning off 命令），以降低漏洞被利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1132","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1132","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47176","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1132.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-1132/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-1132/README_EN.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1132.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1132.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-11325.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-11327.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-11321.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-11324.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-11320.md","https://github.com/Vlad-tri/CVE-2019-1132","https://github.com/petercc/CVE-2019-1132"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0015","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1130","title":"微软 Windows 硬链接特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 系统中的 AppX 部署服务 (AppXSVC) 在处理硬链接时存在漏洞，导致未经授权的低权限用户能够通过精心构造的硬链接欺骗机制提升系统权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11、Windows Server 2019/2022 等多个版本，攻击者无需用户交互即可通过本地访问利用此漏洞，实现对系统关键资源的完全控制。CVSS 评分 7.8，威胁等级为高级，涵盖机密性、完整性和可用性高风险。微软已在 2020 年 8 月累积更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时安装安全更新以增强系统安全性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1130"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-07-15T19:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:27:53Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 7 月安全更新补丁。Windows 10 版本 1903/1909 安装 KB4507453，Windows 10 旧版本（1809 安装 KB4507469，1803 安装 KB4507466，1709 安装 KB4507455，1703 安装 KB4507456），Windows 7/8.1/服务器系统安装 7 月累计更新 KB4507449 或安全专用更新 KB4507465。可通过 Windows Update 自动检测并安装更新。如无法立即打补丁，可通过组策略禁用 AppX 应用程序部署服务（路径为 Computer Configuration → Administrative Templates → Windows Components → App Package Deployment → DisableAppXDeployment），同时限制非管理员用户执行 PowerShell 脚本权限，并监控 AppXSVC 服务的异常行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1130","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1130","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1130.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ccb82e19d454ec66425149e039b563fe786feea5/2019/1xxx/CVE-2019-1130.json","https://github.com/BC-SECURITY/Moriarty/blob/7ad4aa414021cc1be0d1a781cf1b727e3d5d3c34/Moriarty/Msrc/CVE-2019-1130.cs","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1130.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1129.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1130.md","https://github.com/ryanmrestivo/red-team/blob/1e53b7aa77717a22c9bd54facc64155a9a4c49fc/Information-Gathering/_on-host/Watson/Watson/Msrc/CVE-2019-1130.cs","https://github.com/ryanmrestivo/blue-team/blob/34d08be7cb013de6a4d416a5476dd9e0c5810430/_OS_Analysis/Watson/Watson/Msrc/CVE-2019-1130.cs","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-1130.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-1130.json","https://github.com/S3cur3Th1sSh1t/SharpByeBear"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0014","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1129","title":"微软 Windows 特权提升漏洞","description":"这是一个 Windows AppX 部署服务 (AppXSVC) 硬链接处理不当导致的特权提升漏洞。攻击者通过在本地系统上构造恶意硬链接文件，使其覆盖或重定向到敏感系统文件或注册表项，从而获取更高的系统权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 版本，攻击者需要低权限用户权限进行本地攻击，攻击复杂性低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.8 评级为高危。成功利用此漏洞可导致系统完全被控制，攻击者能够获取对关键系统资源的完全访问权限，包括读取、修改和删除所有数据。微软已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞，用户应及时安装补丁以确保系统安全。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1129"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-07-15T19:15:20Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:27:53Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 7 月安全更新：Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 安装 KB4507469，Windows 10 1903 安装 KB4507453，Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4507448（月度汇总）或 KB4507457（仅安全），Windows 7/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4507449（月度汇总）或 KB4507456（仅安全）。如无法立即打补丁，可通过组策略禁用 AppX Deployment Service (AppXSVC) 作为临时缓解措施，路径：计算机配置→管理模板→Windows 组件→应用包部署→关闭 AppX 部署服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1129","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1129","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1129.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ccb82e19d454ec66425149e039b563fe786feea5/2019/1xxx/CVE-2019-1129.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1129.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1129.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1130.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-1129.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-1129.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-1129.json","https://github.com/S3cur3Th1sSh1t/WinPwn/blob/cba1769c2d425a4ddeaae63d7c4441e53be59092/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2019/CVE-2019-11xx/CVE-2019-1129.json","https://github.com/S3cur3Th1sSh1t/SharpByeBear"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0013","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0880","title":"Microsoft splwow64 特权提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 的 splwow64.exe 组件在处理特定打印调用时存在本地权限提升漏洞。该组件用于在 64 位系统上兼容 32 位打印驱动程序，由于对特定函数调用参数验证不当，本地已认证攻击者可构造恶意打印任务或调用特定 API，触发内存破坏或权限不当提升，最终以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。漏洞影响 Windows 7 至 Windows 10 及对应 Server 版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地（AV:L），需低权限（PR:L）且无需用户交互（UI:N）。攻击者需先在目标系统获得普通用户权限，通过提交特制打印作业或调用 splwow64 暴露的 LPC 接口即可利用。Microsoft 已在 2019 年 7 月补丁星期二发布修复补丁（KB4507456 等）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0880"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-07-15T19:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:09:06Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2019 年 7 月安全更新（KB4516071 / KB4516077 等对应各 Windows 版本），通过 Windows Update 自动更新或手动下载安装。无法立即打补丁时，可通过组策略或防火墙限制 splwow64.exe 的网络访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0880","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0880","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0880.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0880.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0880.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-0880.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-0880.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/722d7f304bdff5198e6628e428db4bb3057c598c/CVEs/2019/CVE-2019-0880.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-0880.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/b71fadde1b7e978c5ddefd15cc4442bd1ed5b1e5/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2019-0880","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-0880.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-0880.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0067","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-13396","title":"FlightPath 路径遍历漏洞","description":"FlightPath 4.x 及 5.0-x 版本中存在目录遍历与本地文件包含漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可通过向 `index.php?q=system-handle-form-submit` 发送 POST 请求，在 `form_include` 参数中构造路径穿越序列（如 `../../`），利用 `modules/system/system.module` 中 `system_handle_form_submit` 函数的 `include_once` 调用，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2019-13396"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-10T14:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:16:42Z","remediation":"升级 FlightPath 至 4.8.2 或 5.0-rc2 及以上版本，该漏洞在 system_handle_form_submit 函数中对 form_include 参数进行了严格的路径过滤。如无法立即升级，可在服务器端对 index.php 的 form_include 参数做白名单校验，仅允许指定目录下的文件包含。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://getflightpath.com/node/2650","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153626/FlightPath-Local-File-Inclusion.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47121","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13396.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-13396.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13396.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-13396.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-13396-3815.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-13396-3811.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-13396-3812.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-13396-3814.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-13396.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2019-13396.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-13396/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-13396.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0064","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-13372","title":"D-Link Central WiFi Manager CWM-100 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"D-Link Central WiFi Manager CWM-100 存在严重的代码注入与认证绕过漏洞。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可远程利用该漏洞，通过向目标设备的 /web/Lib/Action/IndexAction.class.php 发送特制的 Cookie 请求，在 username 字段中注入恶意 PHP 代码，同时使用空密码绕过认证机制，最终导致任意 PHP 代码执行。攻击者可借此完全控制受影响设备，窃取敏感信息或将其作为跳板发起进一步攻击。该漏洞影响 v1.03R0100_BETA6 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-13372"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-06T23:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:16:39Z","remediation":"立即将 D-Link Central WiFi Manager CWM-100 升级至 v1.03R0100_BETA6 或更高版本。该版本已修复 Cookie eval 注入、SQL 注入及认证绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截对 /web/Lib/Action/IndexAction.class.php 和 /web/Public/Conn.php 的未授权访问请求，并过滤 Cookie 中 username 字段的特殊字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158904/D-Link-Central-WiFi-Manager-CWM-100-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://github.com/unh3x/unh3x.github.io/blob/master/_posts/2019-02-21-D-link-%28CWM-100%29-Multiple-Vulnerabilities.md","https://supportannouncement.us.dlink.com/announcement/publication.aspx?name=SAP10117","https://unh3x.github.io/2019/02/21/D-link-%28CWM-100%29-Multiple-Vulnerabilities/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13372.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-13372.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13372.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2019/13xxx/CVE-2019-13372.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/dlink/central_wifimanager/CVE-2019-13372.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-13372.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-13372.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2019/CVE-2019-13372.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-13372.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-13372.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13372.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0064.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0064.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0039","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-10717","title":"dotnetblogengine BlogEngine.NET 目录遍历漏洞","description":"BlogEngine.NET 3.3.7.0 版本的文件管理器 API 存在目录遍历漏洞，由于对 path 参数过滤不严，认证后的远程攻击者可通过构造包含 ../ 等特殊字符的路径参数，突破目录限制访问服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者可进一步利用泄露的凭据或配置信息扩大攻击面。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高，影响所有运行 BlogEngine.NET 3.3.7.0 的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-10717"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-03T16:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:11:33Z","remediation":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2019-10717\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2019-10717\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"BlogEngine.NET 文件管理器接口目录遍历漏洞\"\ndescription = \"BlogEngine.NET 3.3.7.0 及之前版本中，/api/filemanager 接口的 path 参数未正确过滤 ../ 等路径遍历序列，导致已认证攻击者可通过构造特制的 path 参数实现目录遍历，越权读取服务器上的任意文件。攻击者只需拥有普通用户权限即可利用，无需特殊网络条件。\"\nseverity = \"HIGH\"\nscore = 7.1\nsources = [\"cve\", \"avd\"]\npublished = \"2019-07-03\"\nupdated = \"2019-07-03\"\nremediation = \"升级到 BlogEngine.NET 3.3.8.0 或更高版本，该版本在 FileManagerRepository.cs 中增加了 SanitizePath 方法，过滤了 ..、\\\\、%2F 等危险字符。如无法升级，建议在反向代理层限制 /api/filemanager 接口的访问权限。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2019-10717\", \"https://github.com/BlogEngine/BlogEngine.NET/commit/ae39067462bbf48588c8c8513c998f64bcfd0d06\", \"http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Jun/44\", \"https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10717.yaml\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = [\"https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10717.yaml\"]\nexp_urls = []\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z\"\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Jun/44","https://github.com/rxtur/BlogEngine.NET/commits/master","https://www.securitymetrics.com/blog/Blogenginenet-Directory-Traversal-Listing-Login-Page-Unvalidated-Redirect","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10717.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-10717.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-10717.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-10717.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-10717.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2019/10xxx/CVE-2019-10717.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/dotnetblogengine/blogengine.net/CVE-2019-10717.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-10717.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-10717/poc/nuclei/CVE-2019-10717.yaml","https://github.com/StarCrossPortal/scalpel/blob/7da815eb1854d6a5622de097c69c432fa5f4e6cf/poc/cve/2019/CVE-2019-10717.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2019-10717.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1520","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7256","title":"Linear eMerge E3系列 命令注入漏洞","description":"Linear eMerge E3 系列门禁控制设备存在操作系统命令注入漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向设备 Web 管理接口发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在输入参数中注入恶意系统命令，从而以 root 权限在目标设备上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 eMerge E3 1.00-06 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需任何认证即可利用，成功利用后可完全控制设备，进而窃取门禁数据、修改权限或作为跳板攻击内网。目前已公开完整的利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7256"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-07-02T19:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:19Z","remediation":"立即将 Linear eMerge E3-Series 固件升级至厂商提供的最新版本（高于 1.00-06），具体固件包请联系厂商 Nortek/Nice 获取。如无法立即升级，应采取以下临时缓解措施：1）将设备从互联网断开，仅允许内网访问；2）在防火墙侧限制对设备 Web 管理端口（80/443）和 SSH 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP；3）修改设备默认管理员密码和默认 IP 地址；4）如需远程管理，必须通过 VPN 接入内网后再访问设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155255/Linear-eMerge-E3-1.00-06-card_scan.php-Command-Injection.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155256/Linear-eMerge-E3-1.00-06-card_scan_decoder.php-Command-Injection.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155272/Linear-eMerge-E3-Access-Controller-Command-Injection.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/170372/Linear-eMerge-E3-Series-Access-Controller-Command-Injection.html","https://applied-risk.com/labs/advisories","https://www.applied-risk.com/resources/ar-2019-005","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7256","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47619","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7256.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7256.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7256.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-7256.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-7256-4217.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-7256-4215.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-7256-4216.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-7256-4213.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-7256/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-7256.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7256.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Linear eMerge/CVE-2019-7256.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1314","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-5786","title":"Google Chrome FileReader 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 72.0.3626.121 之前版本中的 Blink 渲染引擎的 FileReader 组件存在释放后重用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，触发已释放内存对象的非法访问，导致浏览器崩溃或潜在的越界内存访问。该漏洞影响 Windows/Mac/Linux 全平台 Chrome 浏览器，已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，且有 Metasploit 公开利用模块，实际攻击风险较高。Google 已在 2019 年 3 月发布的 Chrome 72.0.3626.121 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-5786"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-06-27T17:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:38:12Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 72.0.3626.121 或更高版本（Chrome 会自动检查更新，也可访问 chrome://settings/help 手动触发更新）。对于基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Edge、Brave），同步更新至对应修复版本。由于该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议启用 Chrome 自动更新功能并确保企业环境中通过组策略强制推送浏览器更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2019/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://crbug.com/936448","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-5786","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46812","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-5786.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2019/5xxx/CVE-2019-5786.json","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/CVE-2019-5786 漏洞分析.md","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Google/（CVE-2019-5786）Chrome 远程代码执行漏洞.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-5786.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-5786.md","https://github.com/nosafer/nosafer.github.io/blob/1b07659147a7781a61e0b950684ad8d7739fadbd/docs/Web安全/Google/（CVE-2019-5786）Chrome 远程代码执行漏洞.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-5786.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-5786.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/GHSA/data/2019/CVE-2019-5786.json","https://github.com/exodusintel/CVE-2019-5786"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1314.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-1314.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0051","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12581","title":"Zyxel ZyWall、USG及UAG设备跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Zyxel ZyWall、USG 及 UAG 系列设备中的 free_time_failed.cgi CGI 程序存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 err_msg 参数注入恶意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码触发该漏洞，导致受害者在浏览器中执行任意脚本，进而可能窃取会话凭证或发起钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响 Zyxel 多款安全网关设备，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。用户应升级至厂商发布的最新固件版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12581"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-27T15:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:14:54Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Zyxel USG 系列固件升级至 4.32 及以上版本，UAG 系列固件升级至 4.20 及以上版本。登录设备管理后台，在\"系统设置→固件升级\"中上传官方固件包进行更新。如无法立即升级，可在\"Free Time\"功能页面禁用该功能，或在 Web 管理界面配置 WAF/IPS 规则对 err_msg 参数进行过滤，阻止跨站脚本攻击。具体固件下载请访问 Zyxel 官方支持门户（support.zyxel.com）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://n-thumann.de/blog/zyxel-gateways-missing-access-control-in-account-generator-xss/","https://sec-consult.com/en/blog/advisories/reflected-cross-site-scripting-in-zxel-zywall/index.html","https://www.zyxel.com/support/vulnerabilities-related-to-the-Free-Time-feature.shtml","https://www.zyxel.com/us/en/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12581.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12581.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12581.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-12581.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/zyxel/uag2100/CVE-2019-12581.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12581.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12581.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-12581.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-12581/poc/nuclei/CVE-2019-12581.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-12581.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2019-12581.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0052","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12583","title":"Zyxel UAG/USG/ZyWall 设备 Free Time 组件访问控制缺失漏洞","description":"Zyxel UAG、USG 及 ZyWall 系列设备中的 \"Free Time\" 组件存在访问控制缺失漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可直接访问账户生成器接口，批量创建访客账户，进而获得未授权网络访问权限或导致服务拒绝（DoS）。该漏洞源于对关键功能缺乏权限校验（CWE-425），攻击者仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可利用，无需任何前置条件，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害严重。受影响的固件版本包括 UAG2100 等型号。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12583"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-27T14:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:14:54Z","remediation":"立即联系 Zyxel 技术支持获取针对具体型号的 hotfix 补丁并安装：UAG2100 升级至 4.18(AAIZ.1)C0 以上、USG110 升级至 4.33(AAPH.0)C0 以上、ZyWall 110 升级至 4.33(AAAA.0)C0 以上，其余型号对应版本详见 Zyxel 安全公告。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙/ACL 层面限制对 /free_time.cgi 及 /free_time_transaction.cgi 路径的外部访问，仅允许受信任的客户端 IP 访问设备管理接口，并启用 MAC 地址过滤和速率限制以缓解账户耗尽型 DoS 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://n-thumann.de/blog/zyxel-gateways-missing-access-control-in-account-generator-xss/","https://www.zyxel.com/support/vulnerabilities-related-to-the-Free-Time-feature.shtml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12583.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12583.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12583.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-12583.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-12583-3784.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12583.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12583.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/zyxel/uag2100_firmware/CVE-2019-12583.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-12583.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-12583/poc/nuclei/CVE-2019-12583.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-12583.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0052.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0057","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12962","title":"LiveZilla Server Accept-Language 反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"LiveZilla Server 8.0.1.1 之前版本存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞，位于 mobile/index.php 页面。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的 Accept-Language HTTP 请求头，当服务器解析并回显该头部内容时，导致恶意脚本在受害者浏览器中执行。攻击者需诱使用户访问特制链接，成功利用后可窃取会话 Cookie、劫持用户会话或实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响 LiveZilla Server 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12962"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-25T13:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:15:48Z","remediation":"立即升级 LiveZilla Server 至 8.0.1.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 mobile/index.php 页面中 Accept-Language HTTP 请求头导致的反射型 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中添加规则，过滤或转义 Accept-Language 请求头中的 HTML 特殊字符（如 < > \" ' &），并限制对 mobile/index.php 的外部直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161867/LiveZilla-Server-8.0.1.0-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://forums.livezilla.net/index.php?/topic/10984-fg-vd-19-083085087-livezilla-server-are-vulnerable-to-cross-site-scripting-in-admin-panel/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49669","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12962.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12962.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12962.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-12962.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/LiveZilla Server/CVE-2019-12962.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-12962.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12962.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-12962.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12962.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/livezilla/livezilla/CVE-2019-12962.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-12962.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0057.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0057.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0056","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-12935","title":"Shopware 后台登录页面跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Shopware 5.5.8 之前版本的后端登录页面存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者可通过向 backend/Login 或 backend/Login/load/ URI 的查询字符串中注入恶意 JavaScript 代码，当管理员用户点击特制链接时，该脚本将在其浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接），影响 Shopware 5.5.8 之前的所有版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2019-12935"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-23T23:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:15:45Z","remediation":"升级 Shopware 至 5.5.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了后端登录页面 Query String 参数未正确过滤导致的反射型 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，对 /backend/Login 及 /backend/Login/load/ 路径的 Query String 参数进行 HTML 特殊字符转义过滤，并限制后台管理页面仅允许可信 IP 访问以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153145/Shopware-5.5.6-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Jun/32","https://www.netsparker.com/web-applications-advisories/ns-19-004-cross-site-scripting-in-shopware/","https://www.shopware.com/en/changelog/#5-5-8","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12935.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-12935.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/1a583c77a151b9c5f4534bb6fe376ed9456e38c3/2019/CVE-2019-12935.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12935.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/shopware/shopware/CVE-2019-12935.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2019/12xxx/CVE-2019-12935.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-12935.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-12935.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/GHSA/data/2019/CVE-2019-12935.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-12935.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-12935.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0056.toml"}]